## Description

It seems that calling tap_code() on the slave side should not be done because the keycode cannot be sent to the host.

If `encoder_update_user()` is the following code

```c
bool encoder_update_user(uint8_t index, bool clockwise) {
    DEBUG_PIN_ON();
    switch (index) {
    case 0: tap_code(clockwise ? KC_A : KC_B); break;
    case 1: tap_code(clockwise ? KC_C : KC_D); break;
    case 2: tap_code(clockwise ? KC_E : KC_F); break;
    case 3: tap_code(clockwise ? KC_G : KC_H); break;
    }
    DEBUG_PIN_OFF();
    return true;
}
```

The timing chart on the master side is as follows. The execution time of `encoder_update_user()` is very short.
<img width="1423" alt="encoder_master2" src="https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2170248/170329840-965ddce3-bda0-43db-95fb-074bad90aaf6.png">

The timing chart on the slave side are as follows. The execution time of `encoder_update_user()` is very long.
As a result, the speed of execution of the main loop is temporarily slowed down and changes in the encoder signals become partially unreadable.
In other words, the same number of inputs as changes in the encoder's signal will not be performed.
<img width="1423" alt="encoder_slave_bug2" src="https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2170248/170329937-f676a9e8-2da7-414e-8362-54b8ec98e991.png">


If `encoder_update_user()` is the following code
```c
#define TAP_CODE(x) if (is_keyboard_master()) { tap_code(x); }

bool encoder_update_user(uint8_t index, bool clockwise) {
    DEBUG_PIN_ON();
    switch (index) {
    case 0: TAP_CODE(clockwise ? KC_A : KC_B); break;
    case 1: TAP_CODE(clockwise ? KC_C : KC_D); break;
    case 2: TAP_CODE(clockwise ? KC_E : KC_F); break;
    case 3: TAP_CODE(clockwise ? KC_G : KC_H); break;
    }
    DEBUG_PIN_OFF();
    return true;
}
```
The timing chart on the slave side are as follows. The execution time of `encoder_update_user()` is very short as well as that of the master side.
<img width="1423" alt="encoder_slave_new2" src="https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2170248/170330343-422a1b3c-aca9-449a-bc99-e238c6169a52.png">


